---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="Tejas Wadhwa is a Computer Engineering student at Purdue working across RTL, embedded systems, and hardware-aware software."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap page-body">
    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        I&#8217;m a Computer Engineering student at Purdue, graduating {SITE.gradDate}. I work
        across RTL and FPGA design, embedded firmware, board-level hardware, and software that
        has to interact with physical systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        My projects include fixed-point audio effects on an Artix-7 FPGA, a basketball
        scoreboard that reached a custom PCB, and the architecture of a wide-IF digital FM
        receiver for an ASIC design course. I also build STM32 systems and the software around
        them, from sensor processing to device protocols and application services.
      </p>
      <p>
        This first version is deliberately concise. The <a href="/projects/">project index</a>
        carries the verified facts; longer articles will follow as I write the decisions,
        failures, and lessons in my own voice.
      </p>

      <h2>Reaching me</h2>
      <p>
        Email is best: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. I&#8217;m also on
        <a href={SITE.github}> GitHub</a> and <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
